# ============================================================
# Logitech Consultants website — environment variables
# ============================================================

# Optional. Points the live site at the Payload CMS REST API so blog posts,
# contact details, and FAQs sync from the admin panel to the site in real time
# (no redeploy needed after an edit — the site re-fetches on load).
#
# Leave UNSET (or omit the file) to run the site in pure static mode with the
# bundled fallback content — the default, and what the E2E suite tests.
#
# Local dev (CMS running in cms/ on port 3100):
#   VITE_CMS_URL=http://localhost:3100
#
# Production (CMS deployed on Vercel):
#   VITE_CMS_URL=https://cms-logitech.vercel.app
#
# VITE_CMS_URL=
